      "description": "Production deployment with rollback",
      "narrationSegment": "Production deployment uses a blue-green strategy. The new version is deployed alongside the old one, traffic is gradually shifted, and if error rates spike, an automatic rollback kicks in within 60 seconds. This gives zero-downtime deployments with built-in safety nets.",
